+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
+  <title>Your privacy | The Daily Grind</title>
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+  <nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a class="logo" href="/">THE DAILY GRIND</a><a href="/">Back to home</a></nav>
+  <main class="container policy">
+    <h1>Your privacy, by default</h1>
+    <p>You can browse this website without creating an account or sharing personal details.</p>
+    <h2>What this website handles</h2>
+    <p>Our server briefly processes the connection and page request needed to deliver this site. The application does not save IP addresses, request URLs, browser information, or access logs. It has no customer database.</p>
+    <h2>No tracking or third-party requests</h2>
+    <p>This website sets no cookies and uses no analytics, advertising, fingerprinting, browser storage, or third-party scripts. Images and styles are served directly from this website. We do not request your camera, microphone, or location.</p>
+    <h2>Storage and your choices</h2>
+    <p>The application keeps no visitor profiles or personal records to access, correct, export, or delete. It asks browsers not to cache responses. You can also clear this website's data in your browser settings.</p>
+    <p><a href="/logout">Clear site data</a> requests removal of this site's cookies, storage, and cache in browsers that support this feature over HTTPS. It does not delete browser history.</p>
+    <h2>Hosting and security</h2>
+    <p>The hosting or network provider may process connection information to deliver the site. Its logging and retention settings are managed separately from this application.</p>
+    <p>Account, rewards, ordering, and payment services are not implemented in this website. If these services are added, their collection, retention, and deletion practices must be explained before personal information is requested.</p>
+  </main>
+  <footer><a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy</a><p>&copy; 2026 The Daily Grind Coffee Co.</p></footer>
+</body>
+</html>
